1lselBkZGVWZ0FlbjRwQ1pZc21tQkNmU0hEMWRDRGM0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"康乃狄克大學籃球隊主場甘佩爾館 (Gampel Pavilion) 在數百萬美元的交易中獲得新名稱"},{"title":"M&T Bank purchases naming rights to Gampel Pavilion","src":"The UConn Blog","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOSTc0Z1p6a0duM0FhQldDS2x2MlZRd3hxLUdOTGR0X19CMl9PRnRTdWV1ajdvek51X1hmYnpZT3VpMExhZmZSNHhONGlnMmxXN3ZWUVNuWFZLeEd2TGlRQkw2NEtWeFUxMUN6ME1qY0RmamkzREFvRlJkUkpwZGZJNFpraVNDXzhjUml6MFFhekZPbWNrZUJOdA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"M&T 銀行購買 Gampel Pavilion 冠名權"},{"title":"Gampel Pavilion to get new name as UConn reaches multiyear rights deal","src":"Hartford Courant","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNNjVWWTVfSmV6dzRsVHZQdHpxd2lvWjN4UHBsS201S1k2cWh5dFp2SDFOUTV6MDZ0WTNkRldsVWpqQ050YmNyczF4UUhPYTlhMHZ2YWZiUlZLYXlHVlVvQklUTEkxdkV0U1pNZGs5Q3VxWnFvWmg0a2h5UVNNTHpKUi1URnF0OW1pOERocGlZeVA0enFmTkZxRmdwZVF3MGRtOERVMTdVUGtvWFE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"康乃狄克大學達成多年版權協議，甘佩爾館將獲得新名稱"}],"themes":[{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/36270/000003627026000010/mtb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"M&T is a New York business corporation that has elected to be treated as an FHC under the BHCA and is a BHC under Article III-A of the New York Banking Law. M&T was incorporated in November 1969. At December 31, 2025, M&T had two wholly-owned bank subsidiaries: M&T Bank and Wilmington Trust, N.A. The banks collectively offer a wide range of retail and commercial banking, wealth management, trust and institutional services to their customers. The Company had consolidated total assets of $213.5 billion, deposits of $166.9 billion and shareholders' equity of $29.2 billion at December 31, 2025. The principal executive offices of M&T and M&T Bank are located in Buffalo, New York.","zh":"M&T 是一家紐約商業公司，根據 BHCA 選擇被視為 FHC，並且是紐約銀行法第 III-A 條規定的 BHC。 M&T 成立于 1969 年 11 月。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，M&T 擁有兩家全資銀行子公司：M&T Bank 與 Wilmington Trust, N.A.。這些銀行共同向客戶提供廣泛的零售和商業銀行、財富管理、信託和機構服務。截至2025年12月31日，該公司的合併總資產為2,135億美元，存款為1,669億美元，股東權益為292億美元。 M&T和M&T銀行的主要執行辦公室位於紐約州布法羅。"},{"en":"M&T Bank is a banking corporation that is incorporated under the laws of the State of New York. M&T Bank is a member of the Federal Reserve System and the FHLB System, and its deposits are insured by the FDIC through its DIF up to applicable limits. M&T acquired all of the issued and outstanding shares of the capital stock of M&T Bank in December 1969. The stock of M&T Bank represents a major asset of M&T. M&T Bank operates under a charter granted by the State of New York in 1892, and the continuity of its banking business is traced to the organization of Manufacturers and Traders Bank in 1856. M&T Bank provides banking products and services through a domestic banking office and ATM network located throughout New York, Maryland, New Jersey, Pennsylvania, Delaware, Connecticut, Massachusetts, Maine, Vermont, New Hampshire, Virginia, West Virginia and the District of Columbia. As a commerc","zh":"M&T Bank 是一家根據紐約州法律註冊成立的銀行公司。 M&T 銀行是聯邦儲備系統和 FHLB 系統的成員，其存款由 FDIC 透過其 DIF 提供最高適用限額的保險。 M&T 於 1969 年 12 月收購了 M&T 銀行所有已發行和流通的股本。 M&T 银行的股票是 M&T 的主要资产。 M&T 銀行根據 1892 年紐約州授予的特許經營權開展業務，其銀行業務的連續性可追溯到 1856 年製造商和貿易銀行的組織。 M&T 銀行透過遍佈紐約、馬裡蘭州、新澤西州、賓州、德拉瓦州、康乃狄克州、麻薩諸塞州、緬因州、佛蒙特州、新罕布夏州、維吉尼亞州、西維吉尼亞州和哥倫比亞特區的國內銀行辦事處和 ATM 網路提供銀行產品和服務。作为一个商业"},{"en":"Wilmington Trust, N.A. is a national bank with total assets of $773 million at December 31, 2025. Wilmington Trust, N.A. and its subsidiaries offer various institutional client and wealth management services. Among other subsidiaries of M&T is M&T Securities, Inc. which provides institutional brokerage and securities services. M&T and its banking subsidiaries have a number of other special-purpose or inactive subsidiaries. These other subsidiaries did not represent, individually or collectively, a significant portion of the Company's consolidated assets, net income and shareholders' equity at December 31, 2025.","zh":"Wilmington Trust, N.A. 是一家全國性銀行，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，總資產為 7.73 億美元。 Wilmington Trust, N.A. 及其子公司提供各種機構客戶和財富管理服務。 M&T 的其他子公司包括 M&T Securities, Inc.，提供機構經紀和證券服務。 M&T 及其銀行子公司還有許多其他特殊目的或不活躍的子公司。截至2025年12月31日，這些其他子公司單獨或合計並不占公司合併資產、淨利和股東權益的很大一部分。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Information about the Company's business segments is included in note 21 of Notes to Financial Statements filed herewith in Part II, Item 8, \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data\" and is further discussed in Part II, Item 7, \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.\" The Company engages in limited international activities including certain trust-related services in Europe, foreign currency transactions associated with customer activity, providing credit to support the international activities of domestic companies and holding certain loans to foreign borrowers. Assets and revenues associated with international activities represent less than 1% of the Company's consolidated assets and revenues.","zh":"有關公司業務部門的資訊包含在隨函提交的第二部分第 8 項「財務報表和補充資料」中的財務報表附註的附註 21 中，並在第二部分第 7 項「管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論和分析」中進一步討論。該公司從事有限的國際活動，包括在歐洲的某些信託相關服務、與客戶活動相關的外幣交易、提供信貸以支持國內公司的國際活動以及向外國借款人持有某些貸款。與國際活動相關的資產和收入占公司合併資產和收入的比例不到 1%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Company faces extensive and intensive competition in the products and services it offers. The Company competes in offering commercial and personal financial and wealth services with other banking institutions and thrifts and with firms in a number of other industries, such as credit unions, personal loan companies, sales finance companies, leasing companies, securities brokerage firms, mutual fund companies, hedge funds, private credit funds, wealth and investment advisory firms, insurance companies and other financial services-related entities. Furthermore, diversified financial services companies are able to offer a combination of these services to their customers on a nationwide basis. Financial technology companies, using digital, mobile and other technologies, including stablecoins, also are increasingly offering traditional banking products and services (or products and service","zh":"公司所提供的產品和服務面臨著廣泛而激烈的競爭。該公司在提供商業和個人金融及財富服務方面與其他銀行機構和儲蓄機構以及許多其他行業的公司競爭，例如信用合作社、個人貸款公司、銷售財務公司、租賃公司、證券經紀公司、共同基金公司、對沖基金、私人信貸基金、財富和投資諮詢公司、保險公司和其他金融服務相關實體。此外，多元化的金融服務公司能夠在全國範圍內向客戶提供這些服務的組合。使用數位、行動和其他技術（包括穩定幣）的金融科技公司也越來越多地提供傳統銀行產品和服務（或產品和服務）"},{"en":"Through a link on the Investor Relations section of M&T's website at www.mtb.com, copies of M&T's Annual Reports on Form 10-K, Quarterly Reports on Form 10-Q and Current Reports on Form 8-K, and amendments to those reports filed or furnished pursuant to Section 13(a) or 15(d) of the Exchange Act, are made available, free of charge, as soon as reasonably practicable after electronically filing such material with, or furnishing it to, the SEC. Copies of such reports and other information are also available at no charge to any person who requests them or at www.sec.gov. Such requests may be directed to M&T Bank Corporation, Shareholder Relations Department, One M&T Plaza, Buffalo, NY 14203 (Telephone: (716) 842-5138).","zh":"透過 M&T 網站 www.mtb.com 投資者關係部分的鏈接，M&T 表格 10-K 年度報告、表格 10-Q 季度報告和表格 8-K 當前報告的副本，以及根據《交易法》第 13(a) 或 15(d) 節提交或提供的報告的修訂，均在以免費報告後儘快提交此類報告。向 SEC 提供或向 SEC 提供資料。此類報告和其他資訊的副本也可免費提供給任何提出要求的人或造訪 www.sec.gov。此類請求可直接寄至 M&T Bank Corporation, Shareholder Rights Department, One M&T Plaza, Buffalo, NY 14203（電話：(716) 842-5138）。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retail Banking","val":4868000000,"zh":"零售銀行業務"},{"name":"Commercial Banking","val":2947000000,"zh":"商業銀行"},{"name":"Institutional Services & Wealth Management","val":1562000000,"zh":"機構服務與財富管理"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":313000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":1657000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Fiduciary & Trust","val":724000000,"zh":"信託與信託"},{"name":"Deposit Account","val":551000000,"zh":"存款帳戶"},{"name":"Credit Card Merchant Discount","val":173000000,"zh":"信用卡商家折扣"},{"name":"Brokerage Services Income","val":131000000,"zh":"經紀服務收入"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":78000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":1657000000}},"peers":["NTRS","PNC","KEY","ZION","MCO"]}}